{
  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "document": {
    "bytes": 28042,
    "path": "docs/architecture/scoped-generation-failure.md",
    "sha256": "fe193048f016c4bdb73cc261d55cad340ebfd9cb8fb35108e3cfd934799e6f94"
  },
  "new_decisions": [
    "Keep storage active_generation=allocated_through=1 unchanged; add no new error probe, SnapshotExpired or unused production types.",
    "A future physical failure may use at most one same-Scope exact HEAD through the original backend/meter/deadline; the verdict cannot rebind the original request, Snapshot, ETag or CAS.",
    "Local budget/configuration limits, typed edge/retained SQL semantics, native InvalidImage and sink failures are not automatically retired-generation expiry.",
    "Refine knowledge by trusted authority domain, full Scope and handle lineage, including independent Catalogue/Recovery construction; do not invent shared durable health.",
    "A new fully verified read may succeed in the same lineage without clearing its publication latch; an independent new handle must satisfy its own fresh authority/materialization/CAS obligations.",
    "Healthy checks are not remote I/O locks: a later latch cannot revoke an already enabled original PUT or an already dispatched token. Backend effects use the original condition. ACK depends on that attempt's own complete commit/native/caller conditions, not an invented final health recheck.",
    "A failed or ended original attempt cannot resume a prefix or adopt another handle's success. A later independent lookup may legitimately prove the original committed receipt.",
    "The codec must not accept A/M/T/holds before all documented publication, read, recovery, provisioning, error-projection and plan-identity consumers are complete."
  ],
  "not_claimed": [
    "Production generation switching, physical DELETE, SnapshotExpired or a generation-health registry is implemented.",
    "The frozen model already proves handle-lineage knowledge or check-to-dispatch/ACK interleavings.",
    "The closure prerequisite has completed composed workspace or actual acceptance through this review.",
    "Raw frame/closure validation proves native SQLite validity, authorization, publication or GC convergence.",
    "A local quarantine latch is global, persistent, a remote I/O lock or cancellation of an original in-flight request.",
    "Metadata-only takeover/policy is committed by this documentation change."
  ],
